        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "12 years ago",
        "text": "This is an absolutely horrible company to deal with! After months of run around for warranty work on my trailer the work was not done! The owner of the company Normand refused to compensate me for my warranty work after I paid someone to fix mix Sure Trac trailer. I was assured that I would be reimbursed and it did not happen.\n\nDo your self a huge favour and avoid Uni Trial at all costs!",
